pace `Bone_Root` location, `Bone_Heading` rotation, `V5_CamFocus`, and ALL 26 camera transforms smooth on **24 fps** (`LINEAR`) so the car never teleports 3.8m every other frame in chase cameras!\\n     * Step car-local secondary motion on **Twos (12 fps `CONSTANT` hold every 2 frames)**: `Bone_Body` pitch/roll, `Bone_Steering_Wheel` / front wheel steer, suspension bones, shift LEDs, brake glow pulses, and `V6_09_ComicFX` aero vortex ribbon flutter \\u0026 wheel smear arcs (toggle/scale aero ribbons on when `v \\u003e 230 km/h` and boost when `drs \\u003e= 0.5`!). Lower `motion_blur_shutter = 0.07` for crisp hand-drawn comic frames.\\n   - **3-Act Dimensional Color Script + Portal Transitions + Impact Frames**:\\n     * Act I (`f=1..788`, `S01..S09`): `sv_dimension = 0.0` (Earth-1610 Miles classic graphic comic dusk);\\n     * Act II (`f=789..1601`, `S09b..S18`): `sv_dimension = 1.0` (Earth-65 Gwen expressionist teal/magenta watercolor);\\n     * Act III (`f=1602..2161`, `S19..S26`): `sv_dimension = 2.0` (Earth-928 2099 cyber obsidian/ultraviolet + neon red);\\n     * Add 2-frame **Dimensional Glitch Spikes** across universe cuts (`f=788..790` and `f=1601..1603`), PLUS 2-frame **Black/White/Crimson Graphic Impact Frames** at `f=1698..1699` (Stowe 331 km/h heavy-braking slam inside Clip 3!) and `f=312..313` (Village hairpin heavy braking).\\n   - **Blender 5.3 Multi-Pass Compositor (`Comp_V6_SpiderVerse`)**:\\n     * Enable ViewLayer passes: `use_pass_normal=True`, `use_pass_mist=True` (`mist_settings`: start `12m`, depth `160m`), `use_pass_z=True`, `use_pass_emit=True`, `use_pass_cryptomatte_object=True`.\\n     * **Anisotropic Kuwahara Painterly Background**: `CompositorNodeKuwahara` applied to background via `Mist` mask (subtle in Act I/III, strong painterly brush wash in Act II Gwen world!), keeping foreground hero car 100% sharp!\\n     * **Screen-Space Normal + Mist Edge Ink**: `CompositorNodeFilter` (`SOBEL` / `KIRSCH`) on `Normal` + `Mist`, distance-faded by `Mist` so foreground/midground geometry gets crisp comic ink creases with zero far-horizon shimmer.\\n     * **Focal-Plane CMYK / Red-Cyan Print Misregistration**: Tone down optical camera `dof` blur (`fstop * 2.2`) and instead drive **Red/Cyan channel pixel offset (`±3..7 px`)** via `CompositorNodeSeparateColor` + `Translate` + `CombineColor` masked by off-focus distance (`Mist` / `|Z - focus|` away from `V5_CamFocus`, forced `0` on hero car, spiked during `f=788..790` \\u0026 `f=1601..1603` portal cuts!).\\n     * **Paper Grain + High-Speed Radial Border Speed-Lines (`v \\u003e 290 km/h`) + Impact Frame Duotone**.\\n2) `pipeline/v6_sv_stills.py` \\u0026 `pipeline/render_v6_sv.py`:\\n   - Render all **26 stylized 1080p stills** (`renders_v6/stills/shot_01_*.jpg`..`shot_26_*.jpg`) + `contact_sheet_v6.jpg` + a genuine **Spider-Verse Comic-Book Multi-Panel Page Poster** (`renders_v6/stills/comic_page_sheet.jpg` with dynamic angled/asymmetric comic panel borders, crisp white gutters, halftone accents, and issue header!).\\n   - Build `pipeline/render_v6_sv.py` (supports `--range START-END --outdir DIR` and full `--all` 2161f mode).\\n   - Render the **3× 4-second (96 frames each = 288 frames total) 1080p 24fps showcase clips**:\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 61..156`** (`S01_RearChase -\\u003e S02_Onboard` beat cut);\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 1290..1385`** (`S15_OrbitCopse -\\u003e S16_ChaseCopse` watercolor sweep);\\n     * `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg` for **`f = 1650..1745`** (`S19_Onboard3 331km/h -\\u003e S20_StoweTele + f=1698..1699 Impact Frame`).\\n3) Wait (`swarm_wait`) until `@env-2` finishes `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` before running the final build \\u0026 renders (you can write all scripts now!). Once rendered \\u0026 PIL-verified, write `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md` + update `README.md`, and hand off to `@sfx`!\",\"time\":\"2026-1