{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:22:19Z","input_tokens":3712,"cache_read_tokens":357741,"output_tokens":1841,"thinking":"Initial assessment: project requires careful examination of all constraints before commencing any coding, encompassing stylistic goals, software specifications, performance limits, and explicit boundaries. The plan involves a thorough review of each criterion to ensure a complete understanding prior to execution.\n\n\nCompositor node names and sockets must be verified precisely in Blender 5.3.0.  Blender 5.x unified the geometry nodes with the compositor, implying possible changes in node IDs and socket names compared to Blender 3.x/4.x.  Specific nodes like `CompositorNodeRLayers` and `CompositorNodeKuwahara` require examination to identify their current inputs and properties, ensuring accurate integration.\n\nCompositor node names and sockets must be verified precisely in Blender 5.3.0. Blender 5.x unified the geometry nodes with the compositor, implying possible changes in node IDs and socket names compared to Blender 3.x/4.x. Specific nodes like `CompositorNodeRLayers` and `CompositorNodeKuwahara` require examination to identify their current inputs and properties, ensuring accurate integration.\n\nFurther investigation into node specifics: verifying exact socket names and parameters, specifically for nodes like `CompositorNodeSeparateColor`, `CompositorNodeCombineColor`, `CompositorNodeTranslate`, and others like `CompositorNodeMath`, `ShaderNodeMath`, and more, to ensure compatibility within the current Blender version's `CompositorNodeTree`. Assessing the rendering time for a sample compositor setup on the target resolution, considering both compositor and EEVEE rendering times to estimate total render duration.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\nimport bpy, time\n\nsc = bpy.context.scene\nsc.render.engine = 'BLENDER_EEVEE'\nsc.eevee.use_raytracing = False\nsc.render.resolution_x = 1920\nsc.render.resolution_y = 1080\n\nvl = sc.view_layers[0]\nfor attr in (\"use_pass_normal\", \"use_pass_mist\", \"use_pass_z\", \"use_pass_emit\", \"use_pass_cryptomatte_object\"):\n    print(f\"ViewLayer.{attr} exists={hasattr(vl, attr)}\")\n    if hasattr(vl, attr):\n        setattr(vl, attr, True)\n\nprint(\"World mist_settings:\", [a for a in dir(sc.world.mist_settings) if not a.startswith(\"_\")])\n\nng = bpy.data.node_groups.new(\"TestComp53\", 'CompositorNodeTree')\ncandidates = [\n    \"CompositorNodeRLayers\",\n    \"CompositorNodeKuwahara\",\n    \"CompositorNodeFilter\",\n    \"CompositorNodeSeparateColor\",\n    \"CompositorNodeCombineColor\",\n    \"CompositorNodeTranslate\",\n    \"CompositorNodeScale\",\n    \"CompositorNodeImage\",\n    \"CompositorNodeGlare\",\n    \"CompositorNodeCryptomatteV2\",\n    \"CompositorNodeLensdist\",\n    \"CompositorNodePixelate\",\n    \"CompositorNodePosterize\",\n    \"CompositorNodeRGBToBW\",\n    \"CompositorNodeValToRGB\",\n    \"ShaderNodeValToRGB\",\n    \"CompositorNodeMath\",\n    \"ShaderNodeMath\",\n    \"CompositorNodeMixRGB\",\n    \"ShaderNodeMix\",\n    \"CompositorNodeValue\",\n    \"ShaderNodeValue\",\n    \"ShaderNodeTexCoord\",\n    \"CompositorNodeTexture\",\n    \"ShaderNodeVectorMath\",\n]\n\nfor cname in candidates:\n    try:\n        n = ng.nodes.new(cname)\n        inps = [(i.name, i.type, getattr(i, \"default_value\", None)) for i in n.inputs]\n        outs = [(o.name, o.type) for o in n.outputs]\n        props = [p.identifier for p in n.bl_rna.properties if p.identifier not in bpy.types.Node.bl_rna.properties]\n        print(f\"OK {cname:30s}\")\n        print(f\"   inputs : {[(a,b) for a,b,_ in inps]}\")\n        print(f\"   outputs: {outs}\")\n        print(f\"   props  : {props}\")\n        if cname in (\"CompositorNodeKuwahara\", \"CompositorNodeFilter\", \"CompositorNodeSeparateColor\", \"CompositorNodeTranslate\"):\n            for i in n.inputs:\n                if i.type == 'MENU' or hasattr(i, \"default_value\"):\n                    try:\n                        print(f\"      input '{i.name}' ({i.type}) default={i.default_value!r}\")\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        print(f\"      input '{i.name}' err={e}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"NO {cname:30s} -> {e}\")\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\86052\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a98b6c71-b658-48ee-9b28-e9a1c116099c\\scratch\\inspect_b53_compositor.py"}}]}
